    "title": "Celebrating Excellence: AKU's 2024 Founder's Day Distinguished Leadership Awardees",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "At Aga Khan University's Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations (AKU-ISMC), we applaud outstanding leadership that shapes our community and beyond.",
    "media": [
